{
  "name": "CAG Answer Gate",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CAG Answer Gate\n\nGate a support bot's draft answer against the pinned canon before it ships. This asks the oracle the *original question* fresh (grounded, `temperature 0`) for a reference answer, then has `/verify` confirm the draft is fully supported — and auto-passes **only** on `verdict: supported` with a grounded quote. Everything else routes to human review.\n\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/cag/answer-gate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{ \"document_id\": 7,\n        \"question\": \"Does the warranty cover water damage?\",\n        \"draft\": \"Yes — the warranty fully covers water damage.\" }'\n# → {\"pass\": false, \"verdict\": \"contradicted\", ...}\n```\n\nThe fail-safe rule: auto-pass ONLY on supported + grounded quote; a non-supported verdict, a fabricated quote (`quote_grounded: false`), or any API error all yield `pass: false`. Pass `document_id` explicitly so both hops target the same document.\n\nNo credentials needed — cag-api does all the work.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cag/answer-gate",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Answer Gate Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "webhookId": "d5e6f7a8-9b0c-4d1e-8f2a-3b4c5d6e7f80"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://cag-api:8000/query",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ question: $json.body.question, temperature: 0, document_id: $json.body.document_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3600000
        }
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Grounded Reference Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://cag-api:8000/verify",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ claim: 'This answer is fully supported by the document: ' + $('Answer Gate Webhook').item.json.body.draft, document_id: $('Answer Gate Webhook').item.json.body.document_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3600000
        }
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Verify Draft Support",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "gate-1",
              "name": "pass",
              "value": "={{ $json.verdict === 'supported' && $json.quote_grounded === true }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-2",
              "name": "verdict",
              "value": "={{ $json.verdict }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-3",
              "name": "quote",
              "value": "={{ $json.quote }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-4",
              "name": "conditions",
              "value": "={{ $json.conditions }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-5",
              "name": "grounded_answer",
              "value": "={{ $('Grounded Reference Answer').item.json.answer }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-6",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.verdict === 'supported' && $json.quote_grounded === true ? 'Draft is grounded-supported by the document.' : 'Escalated: verdict=' + $json.verdict + ', quote_grounded=' + $json.quote_grounded + '. Only supported+grounded auto-passes.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Apply Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [980, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Respond With Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1240, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fail-1",
              "name": "pass",
              "value": "={{ false }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-2",
              "name": "verdict",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-3",
              "name": "quote",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-4",
              "name": "conditions",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-5",
              "name": "grounded_answer",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-6",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'CAG API request failed' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Mark Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [980, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 502
        }
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Respond With Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1240, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
